      "mainSnapshot": "- main:\n  - region \"Objects with a remembered life\":\n    - img \"Objects with a remembered life\"\n    - paragraph: CATALOGUE I / THE HOUSE\n    - heading \"Objects with a remembered life\" [level=1]\n    - paragraph: A collection shaped by provenance, handwork and time.\n    - link \"Enter the catalogue\":\n      - /url: /collections/permanent-archive\n    - link \"Restored selection\":\n      - /url: /collections/restored-pieces\n  - region \"Our craft and materials\":\n    - paragraph: INDEX II / PROVENANCE\n    - blockquote:\n      - heading \"What endures carries the record of how it was made.\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: The catalogue follows each garment from runway provenance to workshop restoration and permanent archive entry.\n    - link \"Read archive notes\":\n      - /url: /collections/permanent-archive\n    - img \"Close-up study of a material\"\n    - paragraph: PLATE IV / ACCESSION 1957.34.1\n    - term: Founded\n    - definition: A continuing workshop tradition since 1987\n    - term: Origin\n    - definition: Acquired from private estates in Paris & Antwerp\n    - term: Maker\n    - definition: Named and catalogued with every object\n    - term: Record\n    - definition: Numbered museum-grade accession certificate\n  - region \"Editorial highlights\":\n    - text: PIECE NO. 01/12 RESTORED RUNWAY 1989–1999 PERMANENT ARCHIVE MUSEUM GRADE CONSERVATION PRIVATE APPOINTMENTS IN MILAN & PARIS\n    - button \"Pause editorial highlights\"\n  - region \"Entries from the permanent record\":\n    - paragraph: CATALOGUE III / OBJECTS\n    - heading \"Entries from the permanent record\" [level=2]\n    - tablist \"Choose a curated collection\":\n      - tab \"Current catalogue\" [selected]\n      - tab \"Archive selection\"\n    - tabpanel \"Current catalogue\":\n      - article:\n        - link \"Open 1990 Pinstripe Double-Breasted Jacket\":\n          - /url: /products/1990-pinstripe-double-breasted-jacket\n          - img \"Navy double-breasted pinstripe wool jacket on a linen dress form in an archive gallery\"\n        - paragraph: Spotlight selection\n        - heading \"1990 Pinstripe Double-Breasted Jacket\" [level=3]:\n          - link \"1990 Pinstripe Double-Breasted Jacket\":\n            - /url: /products/1990-pinstripe-double-breasted-jacket\n        - text: Regular price $1,500.00 Sold out\n      - article:\n        - link \"1999 Technical Cotton Trench\":\n          - /url: /products/1999-technical-cotton-trench\n          - img \"1999 Technical Cotton Trench\"\n        - paragraph: Sartorial Archive\n        - heading \"1999 Technical Cotton Trench\" [level=3]:\n          - link \"1999 Technical Cotton Trench\":\n            - /url: /products/1999-technical-cotton-trench\n        - text: Regular price $1,690.00\n      - article:\n        - link \"1998 Bias-Cut Silk Evening Slip\":\n          - /url: /products/1998-bias-cut-silk-slip\n          - img \"1998 Bias-Cut Silk Evening Slip\"\n        - paragraph: Sartorial Archive\n        - heading \"1998 Bias-Cut Silk Evening Slip\" [level=3]:\n          - link \"1998 Bias-Cut Silk Evening Slip\":\n            - /url: /products/1998-bias-cut-silk-slip\n        - text: Regular price $1,450.00\n      - link \"View all Current catalogue\":\n        - /url: /collections/permanent-archive\n  - region \"Three objects from the archive record\":\n    - paragraph: PLATE V / CONSERVATION STUDY\n    - heading \"Three objects from the archive record\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: Each piece is examined under raking light, stabilized by our conservationist, and released in small curated entries.\n    - img \"Three objects from the archive record\"\n    - button \"1. Open details for 1994 Double-Faced Cashmere Cocoon Coat\"\n    - button \"2. Open details for 1999 Technical Cotton Trench\"\n    - button \"3. Open details for 1998 Bias-Cut Silk Evening Slip\"\n    - paragraph: Garment study room photographed under raking light.\n  - region \"1990 Pinstripe Double-Breasted Jacket\":\n    - region \"Product media gallery\":\n      - figure:\n        - img \"Navy double-breasted pinstripe wool jacket on a linen dress form in an archive gallery\"\n    - heading \"1990 Pinstripe Double-Breasted Jacket\" [level=2]\n    - text: Regular price $1,500.00 Sold out\n    - 'radiogroup \"Condition: Restored\"':\n      - text: \"Condition: Restored\"\n      - radio \"Restored Option unavailable\" [checked] [disabled]\n      - text: Restored Option unavailable\n    - 'radiogroup \"Size: FR 40 / US 8\"':\n      - text: \"Size: FR 40 / US 8\"\n      - radio \"FR 40 / US 8 Option unavailable\" [checked] [disabled]\n      - text: FR 40 / US 8 Option unavailable\n    - text: Quantity\n    - button \"Decrease quantity for 1990 Pinstripe Double-Breasted Jacket\" [disabled]\n    - spinbutton \"Quantity\": \"1\"\n    - button \"Increase quantity for 1990 Pinstripe Double-Breasted Jacket\" [disabled]\n    - button \"Sold out\" [disabled]\n    - status: Sold out\n    - paragraph: Climate-controlled archival transport | Insured courier\n    - paragraph: Narrow chalk stripes run across a structured wool jacket with a peaked lapel and six-button front. Masterfully conserved under Record AR-1990-01. Single historical piece, 1 of 1.\n    - paragraph\n  - region \"New entries in the archive\":\n    - paragraph: CATALOGUE NOTICES\n    - heading \"New entries in the archive\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: Occasional notices of restored objects, new records and workshop visits.\n    - text: Email address\n    - textbox \"Email address\":\n      - /placeholder: name@example.com\n    - button \"Subscribe\""
